  "objectives": [
    "推出 $W_n=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^n x\\,dx$ 的遞迴 $W_n=\\frac{n-1}{n}W_{n-2}$，以及起點 $W_0=\\frac\\pi2$、$W_1=1$",
    "看 $n$ 的奇偶直接寫出值：偶數最後乘 $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$，奇數最後乘 $1$",
    "用對稱性處理 $\\cos^n$、$[0,\\pi]$ 的區間，以及 $\\sin^m\\cos^n$（偶數次方）的乘積"
  ],
  "visual": null,
  "concept": [
    {
      "heading": "① 遞迴從哪裡來",
      "body": [
        "起點：$W_0=\\dfrac\\pi2$，$W_1=\\Big[-\\cos x\\Big]_0^{\\pi/2}=1$",
        "分部積分（$n\\ge2$）：$u=\\sin^{n-1}x$，$dv=\\sin x\\,dx$",
        "邊界項 $=0$：$x=\\frac\\pi2$ 時 $\\cos=0$；$x=0$ 時 $\\sin^{n-1}0=0$（$n-1\\ge1$）"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "W_n=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^nx\\,dx,\\quad n=0,1,2,\\dots",
        "du=(n-1)\\sin^{n-2}x\\cos x\\,dx,\\quad v=-\\cos x",
        "\\begin{aligned}W_n&=\\Big[-\\sin^{n-1}x\\cos x\\Big]_0^{\\pi/2}+(n-1)\\,I\\\\I&=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^{n-2}x\\cos^2x\\,dx\\end{aligned}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "① 解出 $W_n$",
      "body": [
        "$\\cos^2x=1-\\sin^2x$，所以 $I=W_{n-2}-W_n$：",
        "$W_n$ 兩邊都有：移項（跟 4.20 的循環積分一樣）",
        "直覺：$\\sin^2+\\cos^2=1$，兩塊面積一樣，各佔一半",
        "「面積一樣」在 ③ 會用換元證明"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "W_n=(n-1)\\big(W_{n-2}-W_n\\big)",
        "nW_n=(n-1)W_{n-2}",
        "W_n=\\frac{n-1}{n}\\,W_{n-2}\\quad(n\\ge2)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "② 一路降下去",
      "body": [
        "偶數：",
        "奇數：",
        "一般式（對 $m$ 歸納，每降一步多乘一個因子）：",
        "雙階乘記號：$W_{2m}=\\frac{(2m-1)!!}{(2m)!!}\\cdot\\frac\\pi2$，$W_{2m+1}=\\frac{(2m)!!}{(2m+1)!!}$",
        "奇偶決定有沒有 $\\pi$：偶數落在 $W_0=\\frac\\pi2$，奇數落在 $W_1=1$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\begin{aligned}W_6&=\\tfrac56W_4=\\tfrac56\\cdot\\tfrac34W_2\\\\&=\\tfrac56\\cdot\\tfrac34\\cdot\\tfrac12W_0=\\tfrac{15}{48}\\cdot\\tfrac\\pi2\\\\&=\\tfrac{5\\pi}{32}\\approx0.4909\\end{aligned}",
        "W_5=\\tfrac45\\cdot\\tfrac23\\cdot W_1=\\tfrac8{15}",
        "\\begin{aligned}W_{2m}&=\\frac{(2m-1)(2m-3)\\cdots1}{(2m)(2m-2)\\cdots2}\\cdot\\frac\\pi2\\\\[4pt]W_{2m+1}&=\\frac{(2m)(2m-2)\\cdots2}{(2m+1)(2m-1)\\cdots3}\\cdot1\\end{aligned}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "② 試一題",
      "body": [
        "檢查：$W_n$ 隨 $n$ 遞減",
        "數值：$1.571,\\ 1,\\ 0.785,\\ 0.667,\\ 0.589,\\ 0.533,\\ 0.491$",
        "原因：$0\\le\\sin x\\le1$ ⇒ $\\sin^{n+1}x\\le\\sin^nx$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\begin{aligned}&\\tfrac\\pi2>1>\\tfrac\\pi4>\\tfrac23\\\\&>\\tfrac{3\\pi}{16}>\\tfrac8{15}>\\tfrac{5\\pi}{32}>\\cdots\\end{aligned}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 對稱性：$\\cos^n$",
      "body": [
        "令 $x=\\frac\\pi2-t$，$dx=-dt$，$\\cos(\\frac\\pi2-t)=\\sin t$：",
        "區間 $[0,\\pi]$：$\\displaystyle\\int_0^\\pi\\cos^4x\\,dx$",
        "拆成兩半；後半令 $x=\\pi-t$，$\\cos(\\pi-t)=-\\cos t$："
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\cos^nx\\,dx=\\int_{\\pi/2}^{0}\\sin^nt\\,(-dt)=W_n",
        "\\int_{\\pi/2}^{\\pi}\\cos^4x\\,dx=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}(-\\cos t)^4\\,dt=W_4",
        "\\int_0^\\pi\\cos^4x\\,dx=2W_4=2\\cdot\\tfrac34\\cdot\\tfrac12\\cdot\\tfrac\\pi2=\\tfrac{3\\pi}8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 奇數次方會抵消",
      "body": [
        "$n$ 奇數：$(-\\cos t)^n=-\\cos^nt$，後半 $=-W_n$",
        "$\\sin(\\pi-t)=\\sin t$，沒有負號："
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int_0^\\pi\\cos^nx\\,dx=\\begin{cases}2W_n,&n\\text{ 偶數}\\\\0,&n\\text{ 奇數}\\end{cases}",
        "\\int_0^\\pi\\sin^nx\\,dx=2W_n\\quad(\\text{所有 }n)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "④ 乘積：$\\sin^m x\\cos^n x$",
      "body": [
        "$\\cos$ 是偶數次方：$\\cos^2x=1-\\sin^2x$，全部換成 $\\sin$",
        "一般：$\\cos^{2k}x=(1-\\sin^2x)^k$，二項式展開",
        "例：$\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^3x\\cos^2x\\,dx=W_3-W_5=\\tfrac23-\\tfrac8{15}=\\tfrac2{15}$",
        "也可以用 4.24：$\\cos$（或 $\\sin$）有奇數次方時，換元 $u=\\cos x$ 一樣得 $\\frac2{15}$",
        "兩個都是奇數次方時，用 4.24 的換元比較快"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^4x\\cos^2x\\,dx",
        "=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\big(\\sin^4x-\\sin^6x\\big)dx=W_4-W_6",
        "=\\frac{3\\pi}{16}-\\frac{5\\pi}{32}=\\frac{\\pi}{32}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "④ 試一題",
      "body": [
        "另一條路驗算：$\\sin x\\cos x=\\tfrac12\\sin2x$",
        "一題兩種做法對得上，答案就很可靠"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\begin{aligned}\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\tfrac14\\sin^22x\\,dx&=\\tfrac14\\cdot\\tfrac12\\int_0^{\\pi}\\sin^2u\\,du\\\\&=\\tfrac18\\cdot2W_2=\\tfrac\\pi{16}\\end{aligned}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "重點整理",
      "body": [
        "• $W_n=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^nx\\,dx$：$W_n=\\frac{n-1}{n}W_{n-2}$，$W_0=\\frac\\pi2$、$W_1=1$",
        "• 偶數：最後乘 $\\frac\\pi2$；奇數：最後乘 $1$",
        "• $\\cos^n$ 在 $[0,\\frac\\pi2]$ 上也是 $W_n$",
        "• $[0,\\pi]$：$\\sin^n$ 是 $2W_n$；$\\cos^n$ 偶數 $2W_n$、奇數 $0$",
        "• 乘積：偶數次方的 $\\cos$ 換成 $1-\\sin^2$，變成幾個 $W$",
        "下一課：Wallis 乘積"
      ]
    }
  ],
